# Solutions Overview

## EdgeLink®
Intelligent infrastructure solutions including cabinets, power systems, and remote monitoring for edge network deployments.

## OSP Solutions  
Outside plant fiber management products: fiber distribution hubs (FDH), fiber patch panels, splice closures, and fiber management hardware for FTTH deployments.

## Cellenium®
Solutions for small cell and DAS (Distributed Antenna System) deployments in wireless networks.

## IoT / Smart Infrastructure / Industrial Monitoring
Westell's newer business focus areas under development by the business development team, exploring IoT device integration, smart city applications, and industrial monitoring use cases leveraging their edge infrastructure expertise.
